  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the Ministry of Education of Nicaragua for improving the quality and effectiveness of initial and continuous teacher education in early childhood education and participate in the ERCE study 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aim is to support and develop capacities in national and local MoE staff to a) improve and expand the quality of teacher education in early childhood through implementing a teachers&#xb4; strategy impacting teacher training institutions, such as the newly established Escuelas Normales Superiores; b) participate in the ERCE study 2025 to assess third and sixth grade students&#xb4; skills in math, language and writing and science, to be implemented in 2025, and which results will be disseminated and analyzed to impact public policy.</narrative>
  </description>
